# Start Server When Done

After making code changes to the eBay Bot project, **always start the server** so the user can test without manual steps.

## Steps (in order)

1. **Kill any server already on port 5001** – run this first:
   ```powershell
   $p = (Get-NetTCPConnection -LocalPort 5001 -State Listen -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue).OwningProcess | Select-Object -First 1
   if ($p) { Stop-Process -Id $p -Force }
   Start-Sleep -Seconds 2
   ```

2. **Start the server** (run in background):
   ```powershell
   cd c:\eBayBot
   $env:LOCAL_DEV="1"
   $env:IMAGE_FETCH_DEBUG="1"
   python app.py
   ```

Always kill before start. The user will manually stop the server (Ctrl+C) when needed.
